  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-vector-simplification.\n\n- Simplifies vector geometries using Douglas-Peucker or Visvalingam-Whyatt algorithms.\n- Supports LineString, Polygon (with holes), Multi* and GeometryCollection types, recursively.\n- Reports vertex reduction ratio and area retention rate.\n- Offers offline processing; all user data handled locally.\n- Includes `--synthetic` mode for generating high-density test features.\n- Output includes simplified GeoJSON, stats JSON, and a run manifest.",
